  "gate_as_worded": "REFUTED, as registered before the run: dilution contributes 0.0e+00 decades of the 9.392136 that separate a stable protein from a short-lived one, and in a steady state division compresses the separation 8.80-fold. What separates them is turnover, which separates them just as well in a cell that never divides",
